  "html": "<div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><h1 style=\"text-align: center\">Unser D-Wurf</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">28.03.2012</p>\n<hr class=\"fx-sep\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Ally Mc Beal – Flat-XP</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/allynew1-1.jpg\" alt=\"Ally\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">FTW Rondix Woodcock at Hawksthorn (Pepper)</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/pipernew1-1.jpg\" alt=\"Pepper\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unser D-Wurf ist am 27. 03.2012 ab 20 h im Viertelstundentakt angekommen:</strong><br>\nZuerst 5 Mädchen, dann 1 Stunde Pause – dann 2 Rüden, und um 0,30 h<br>\neine Nachzüglerin. Somit gibt´s 6 Hündinnen und 2 Rüden – perfekt!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>seit dem 25.5. verlassen uns nun täglich die Welpen</strong><br>\n<strong> einige neue Impressionen davon sind in den Galerien online!</strong></p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>New photos of our puppies!</strong></h3>\n</div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/flatxpd16-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"356\" height=\"267\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-